;;; A goal's `(absent (says (neq ?g Bob)))` holds of everything —
;;; M1f **W83**, register row `W83/pattern-argument-goal`, filed by S1f.7.3 (T1f.7.3.2,
;;; 2026-11-11).
;;;
;;; ── What this program is ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
;;;
;;; Two guests, the fact `(says (paid Ann))`, and a goal whose `(absent …)` is over a
;;; pattern holding a guard, `(says (neq ?g Bob))`. No candidate.
;;;
;;; ── The answer, by hand ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
;;;
;;; `neq` heads no fact: refused at load, at the pattern, one line, on every command.
;;;
;;; ── What the engine answered ──────────────────────────────────────────────
